<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - April 25.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - April 25.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    92/95     99/102     UNQ     190/196</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   98/100   104/106   200/205   213/216</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker quotes on Friday were steady amid a very quiet market, traders said. They said demand is thin ahead of the weekend as most shipowners have already covered their requirements, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
